course: dictionary
lesson: 5345
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Kill is a small word with big meanings. Its main meaning is to make a living thing die. «The 2004 Indian Ocean tsunami killed about 230,000 people in 14 countries.» Here kill is serious: people died.
explain: Check the words around it to find the meaning. «My feet are killing me» does not mean anyone is dying. The speaker means their feet hurt very much, so this is an informal phrase. Ask yourself: does the sentence describe real harm, or is it a figure of speech?
explain: Kill can also be a noun. A lion's kill is the animal it has caught and killed. Phrases such as «kill time» mean to do something while you wait, and «killer whale» is simply the name of a sea animal. Context tells you which meaning is right.
fact: Kill means to make a person, animal or plant die.
fact: Informal: «My feet are killing me» means they hurt very much.
fact: Informal: «kill time» means do something while you wait.
fact: «Vultures» have strong stomach acid that kills germs in the food they eat.
fact: As a noun, a kill is an animal killed by another animal, such as a lion's kill.
exercise: «The tsunami killed about 230,000 people in 14 countries.» What does killed mean here? | Made people tired | *Made people die | Made people move house | Made people laugh
exercise: «My feet are killing me after the long walk.» What does killing mean here? | Hunting | Dying | *Hurting very much | Stopping
exercise: Ella says, «I will kill time until the bus comes.» What does kill time mean? | Fight with the clock | Stop the bus | *Do something while you wait | Hurt yourself
test: «Vultures' strong stomach acid kills germs.» What does kills mean here? | Makes germs grow | Hurts the vulture | Cleans the sea | *Makes germs die
test: «The lion ate its kill at sunset.» What is a kill? | A lion's bed | *An animal killed by another animal | The setting sun | A fast run
exam: Which sentence uses kill in an informal way? | The soap kills germs | The frost can kill plants | The dragon was killed in the story | *My feet are killing me
